app.*.symbols

# Obfuscation related
app.*.map.json

# Android Studio will place build artifacts here
/android/app/debug
/android/app/profile
/android/app/release

# The upstream Noto Sans KR variable font, which is only the *source*
# `tool/build_fonts.py` cuts the app's two static faces from. Those faces are
# committed under assets/fonts/; this 10 MB original is not, because nothing
# but a regeneration ever reads it. The script says how to fetch it.
/test/fonts/

# Firebase service-account keys. `google-services.json` is committed on
# purpose — it ships inside every APK and is not a secret — but a service
# account signs FCM sends and must never be in the repository. It lives in
# Supabase Edge Function secrets as FCM_SERVICE_ACCOUNT.
*-firebase-adminsdk-*.json
**/service-account*.json

# The icon preview is rendered from the three PNGs beside it; it is a thing
# to look at while choosing, not a thing the app or the build reads.
tool/icon/preview.png
